		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>One year today my friend Charles (Shambu)  left his body to the earth. Having known this beautiful man I can only imagine his current state of  consciousness.  Charles was not only an excellent  acupuncturist, but a true healer, there are many of the former but few of the latter. To  have both in one person is truly a blessing. He was a healer of the highest order, with an awesome ability to sense the source of life, in a heartbeat.   &#8220;May all beings be happy&#8221;</p>
<p>                   Thank you Shambu.            your friend Ryan-</p>
